{
  "_comment": "Eval fleet for the requested open-source models. Each entry hits an OpenAI-compatible /chat/completions endpoint. Slugs verified against the OpenRouter catalog on 2026-06-10. `mode` documents the model's behavior (standard | reasoning | multimodal) and drives reasoning-aware preflight/budget handling. `toolMode: \"prompted\"` is for models with NO native function calling (the Phi-4 family): the harness omits `tools`/`tool_choice` and drives the flow via a JSON protocol in the system prompt instead.",
  "_modes": {
    "standard": "native tool-calling instruct model (default)",
    "reasoning": "emits hidden reasoning tokens; gets a larger token budget, lenient preflight, and reasoning passthrough",
    "multimodal": "accepts images natively; we only send text, so the text path is what's exercised",
    "toolMode=prompted": "no native tools; tool schemas go in the system prompt and calls are parsed from text"
  },
